<title>JAPAN: Nippon Concrete - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Concrete - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.30		vs	   19.64</p>
<p> Operating   loss 124 million	 vs    prft 53 million</p>
<p> Current	     47 million	 vs	  157 million</p>
<p> Net		   41 million	 vs	  104 million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.91 yen	  vs	    2.31 yen</p>
<p> Shares		45 million	 vs	   45 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  1.50 yen	  vs	    1.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Concrete Industries Co Ltd is a manufacturer of concrete products, especially poles.</p>
</text>
